pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: top-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 6]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: dir-badge-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 10, 80, 20]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: dir-badge-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 10, 80, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        Ch04
  - elementId: ev-badge-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [1060, 10, 160, 20]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: ev-badge-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1060, 10, 160, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        E3 / Draft
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 36, 990, 42]
    content:
      fontSize: 32
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>NanoZone: CCA 细粒度内存保护 — 背景与方案</strong></p>
  - elementId: title-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 80, 120, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: bg-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 92, 200, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>研究背景</strong></p>
  - elementId: bg-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 128, 1160, 210]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <ul>
        <li>只用 Realm/VM 粒度会在管理成本、保护域数量和应用内敏感数据隔离之间形成矛盾。</li>
        <li>细粒度隔离需求与 CCA 现有 granule/lifecycle 机制的可扩展性之间存在张力。</li>
        </ul>
  - elementId: sep-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 350, 1160, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$border"
  - elementId: sol-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 370, 200, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>解决方案</strong></p>
  - elementId: sol-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 406, 1160, 280]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>研究 CCA granule/lifecycle 能否支撑更小保护域，并用辅助材料对照进程内信任收缩问题。</p>
        <ul>
        <li>Fine-grained memory protection over CCA</li>
        <li>Granule/lifecycle scaling</li>
        <li>Intra-process isolation comparison</li>
        </ul>
  - elementId: source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 690, 1160, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        来源：NanoZone: CCA 细粒度内存保护｜证据等级：E3 / Draft-not-ratified
  - elementId: bottom-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 714, 1280, 6]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
